id: ki-avatar
name: Ki Avatar
uaType: both
prerequisite: Insight Score of 8+
tpCost: 20
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerTier: 8
# "Create a Ki Avatar around your body" - applied when used; "Spend 4(bT) Ki Points at the start of each of your turns to
# maintain the Ki Avatar. If you do not, your Ki Avatar disappears" - paid on its own with a Stop on the card (chat.mjs
# upkeepUniques).
sustained: true
upkeepKiPerBaseTier: 4
# "If your Size Category is smaller than Gigantic, your Size Category is considered Gigantic for calculating the benefits
# and penalties of Size ... and for all rules detailed on the Size page except Punching Up" - the Size the character is
# prepared at while it is applied (actor-character.mjs); Punching Up and the Apparel on the body read the one beneath.
avatarSize: gigantic
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Ki Avatar: Gigantic for Size and its rules but Punching Up, while it lasts; 4(bT) KP at the start of each of your
  turns, or it disappears.
text: >
  Ki Avatar: You create a much larger version of yourself out of energy.
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 8+
  –TP Cost: 20
  –KP Cost: 8(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Create a Ki Avatar around your body. While you possess a Ki Avatar, if your Size Category is smaller than
  Gigantic, your Size Category is considered Gigantic for calculating the benefits and penalties of Size (see — the Size
  Table) and for all rules detailed on the Size page except Punching Up.

  Spend 4(bT) Ki Points at the start of each of your turns to maintain the Ki Avatar. If you do not, your Ki Avatar
  disappears.
